  "description": [
    "In this university project we got 7 weeks to work on any experimental game related to the topic \"(dis)entanglement.\" As the sole designer of the group I developed the game concept, that players find their path through (dis)entangled moebius strips in order to gain rewards with which they can enlarge the structure. Furthermore I contributed the sound design & sound programming of the game. "
